sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Builder in Servant
  participant S as Servant server
  participant A as Sandboxed app or prototype
  participant O as Business owner
  participant M as Mail command
  participant G as Agent chat
  B->>S: Open project preview
  S-->>B: Servant screen with /a/project/ iframe
  B->>A: Use, comment or edit with sample data
  A-->>B: Bridge reports click, words and location
  B->>G: Review drafted ask, then send
  B->>S: Share prototype with an email
  S->>M: Send review link
  O->>S: Open /review/link and request code
  S->>M: Send one-time code
  O->>S: Verify code and add a comment
  S->>S: Store hashed session and append-only comment
  S-->>B: To-do and alert for the comment
  B->>S: Open own preview
  S-->>B: Numbered review pins
